# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Firmware and CPU microcode for common hardware (Debian non-free-firmware),
# so Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, graphics and sound work out of the box. A selection
# for PCs and laptops: firmware for servers, network switches and TV cards
# stays out (installable later).
firmware-linux-free
firmware-misc-nonfree
# Graphics (NVIDIA: needed by the open nouveau driver on recent cards)
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-intel-graphics
firmware-nvidia-graphics
# Wi-Fi and Bluetooth: Intel, Realtek, Qualcomm Atheros, Broadcom,
# MediaTek, Marvell (e.g. Microsoft Surface)
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-brcm80211
firmware-mediatek
firmware-libertas
bluez-firmware
# Sound: Intel audio DSPs (SOF) and the Cirrus Logic speaker amplifiers of
# many recent laptops
firmware-intel-sound
firmware-sof-signed
firmware-cirrus
# Intel sensor hub (screen rotation, lid and light sensors) and NPU
firmware-intel-misc
# CPU microcode (security and stability fixes)
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
